  "system": {
    "description": "<p>Roots and brambles burst from beneath the ground to bind your foes.</p><p>Choose a target within <strong>10 spaces</strong>. It must make an opposed <strong>Reflexes</strong> check or become <strong>Restrained</strong> until the start of your next turn.</p><p>Each extra success extends the duration by <strong>+1 rounds</strong>.</p><p>Alternatively, you may increase the number of targets by <strong>+1</strong> per extra success.</p><p><strong>Effect:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.UoSWWT3pqztnEnjd]{Entangling Roots}</p>",
